sequenceDiagram
    title DSD — CU-033 Activar Desactivar Chofer
autonumber
participant CTRL as DeliveryController
participant SRV as DeliveryService
participant DREP as RepositoryDelivery
participant REDIS as RedisService

Note over CTRL: «include» CU-110 Buscar Chofer por Usuario
CTRL->>CTRL: acotar(id, distributorId), solo con distribuidora en contexto
CTRL->>SRV: findOne(id)
activate SRV
SRV->>DREP: findOne(where delivery_id, relations user y user.role)
activate DREP
DREP-->>SRV: Delivery o null
deactivate DREP
SRV-->>CTRL: Delivery, o NotFoundException si no existe
CTRL->>SRV: assertAlcance(delivery, null, distributorId)
alt Chofer de otra distribuidora que la del contexto
    SRV-->>CTRL: NotFoundException Delivery with ID not found
else Misma distribuidora o sin distribuidora en contexto
    SRV-->>CTRL: sin error
    deactivate SRV
    CTRL->>SRV: toggleActiveStatus(id, dto.isEnabled), dto validado por ToggleDeliveryStatusDto
    activate SRV
    SRV->>SRV: findOne(id)
    SRV->>DREP: findOne(where delivery_id, relations user y user.role)
    activate DREP
    DREP-->>SRV: Delivery o null
    deactivate DREP
    alt Chofer inexistente
        SRV-->>CTRL: NotFoundException Delivery with ID not found
        deactivate SRV
    else Chofer encontrado
        SRV->>SRV: delivery.isEnabled igual isEnabled
        alt Se deshabilita
            SRV->>SRV: delivery.isAvailable igual false
            SRV->>DREP: save(delivery)
            activate DREP
            DREP-->>SRV: Delivery actualizado
            deactivate DREP
            SRV->>REDIS: removeDriver(delivery.userId)
            activate REDIS
            REDIS-->>SRV: chofer sacado del radar drivers:locations
            deactivate REDIS
        else Se habilita
            SRV->>DREP: save(delivery)
            activate DREP
            DREP-->>SRV: Delivery actualizado
            deactivate DREP
        end
        SRV-->>CTRL: Delivery
    end
end
